   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Planeringsbidrag (PDC) - Syftet &#xe4;r att stimulera partners att m&#xf6;tas   och unders&#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheterna till ett h&#xe5;llbart samarbete. Svenska      privata akt&#xf6;ren Kairos Future planerar att hitta parter i Kina f&#xf6;r    att etablera aff&#xe4;rsf&#xf6;rbindelser betr&#xe4;ffande analyser av sociala       medier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning grant (PDC) - the purpose is to stimulate partners to meet   and explore possibilities for sustainable partnership. Swedish        private actor Kairos Future is planning to identify partners in China for establishing commercial relations regarding analyzes of social    media.</narrative>
